# The Hindi ASR checkpoint is 140 MB, and GitHub refuses a blob over 100 MB.
# It is tracked through Git LFS rather than left out of the repo: an asset
# directory declared in pubspec.yaml and empty on disk fails the build, and a
# teammate cloning the repo would get an APK whose Hindi microphone appears
# and then fails at first tap.
#
# After cloning: `git lfs install && git lfs pull`.
# app/test/on_device_voice_test.dart fails on an unfetched pointer file, so
# that mistake surfaces in a test run rather than on a patient's phone.
#
# whisper-tiny predates this and is a plain blob — its largest file is 89 MB,
# under the limit, and rewriting history to move it would cost more than it
# buys.
app/assets/asr/indic-hi/*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
